{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Movement｜流程图\n一次本地移动预测的主路径。结构接口见 [[GGYGO_结构_移动与位移.canvas|结构图]]、[[Movement/结构|结构文档]]；曲线细节 [[GGYGO_流程_动画曲线处理.canvas|子图]]。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1750,
      "height": 145,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "input",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. HeroComponent 提交移动轴值或 ForceWalk。\n\nInput_Move(Value) → AddMovementInput；ForceWalk Pressed/Released → CMC::SetForceWalkRequested。\nGA_Dodge / RequestRunOnNextMove 调用链未接入，当前仅占位。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 392,
      "width": 385,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "resolve",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. CMC 在移动更新前解算步态、转身/急停与限制 Tag。\n\nUpdateCharacterStateBeforeMovement：有输入先 Walk；持续满 MovementSet.WalkToRunHoldSeconds（默认 1.5 秒）升 Run；ForceWalk 保持 Walk；随后推进 TurnBack/Stop。",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 392,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "curve",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. CMC::TickComponent 在 Super 前采当前动画曲线。\n\nSampleAnimCurves(dt) → Sampler::Sample；建立本帧 CurveMotion，供随后 CMC 更新读取；动作源仍经 RMS::PrepareRootMotion。",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 392,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "physics",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. CMC 的 GetMaxSpeed、PhysicsRotation 与原生物理/碰撞执行位移。\n\nCMC::GetMaxSpeed/PhysicsRotation 消费 CurveMotion；Super CMC Tick 与 UE 物理碰撞推进位移。",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 392,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "saved",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5. SavedMove 记录自定义状态，客户端预测和服务器重演使用相同输入。\n\nFSavedMove_GGYGO::SetMoveFor/PrepMoveFor 保存恢复 Gait、转身与 CurveMotion；CanCombineWith 防不兼容合并。",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 932,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "anim",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "6. CMC 的步态发布给 WalkRun BlendSpace。\n\nGetResolvedGait → AnimationStateCapture → GaitBlendY（Run=1、Walk=0）→ WalkRun X 轴 WalkRunBlendAlpha。\nEnterMove 单次播放 → 剩余比例 ≤ 0.03 → Moving；避免起步循环挡住 WalkRun。",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 986,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "target",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "目标拆环：MotionProfile 成为权威移动曲线来源，当前尚未落地。",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "input",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "curve",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "本帧移动请求"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "fromNode": "curve",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "resolve",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "CurveMotion 供移动更新读取"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "fromNode": "resolve",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "physics",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Gait / 速度上限 / RootMotion"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "fromNode": "physics",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "saved",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "预测重演"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
      "fromNode": "physics",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "anim",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "只读语义输出"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6",
      "fromNode": "curve",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "target",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "后续替换采样来源"
    }
  ]
}
